  "narration_text_source": "Latest user-approved ElevenLabs text from conversation (368 words); semantic transcript not independently ASR-verified",
  "cue_alignment_method": "Heuristic paragraph alignment using known text lengths and detected natural waveform pauses; not forced word-level alignment.",
  "audio_cues": [
    {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "start_seconds": 0.0,
      "end_seconds": 5.62,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 169,
      "transcript": "In this town, a giant die rolls every sunrise. Today, it landed on three.",
      "timing_status": "estimated_from_script_length_and_waveform_pauses_not_word_level_forced_alignment"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "start_seconds": 5.62,
      "end_seconds": 11.24,
      "start_frame": 169,
      "end_frame": 337,
      "transcript": "All across the plaza, people rose off the ground. A baker grabbed his stall as his shoes floated away.",
      "timing_status": "estimated_from_script_length_and_waveform_pauses_not_word_level_forced_alignment"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 3,
      "start_seconds": 11.24,
      "end_seconds": 12.74,
      "start_frame": 337,
      "end_frame": 382,
      "transcript": "Everyone was rising. Except Leo.",
      "timing_status": "estimated_from_script_length_and_waveform_pauses_not_word_level_forced_alignment"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 4,
      "start_seconds": 12.74,
      "end_seconds": 21.04,
      "start_frame": 382,
      "end_frame": 631,
      "transcript": "He'd tied himself to the clock tower. Leo hated surprises. He even kept a notebook listing what to do if the town suddenly lost gravity.",
      "timing_status": "estimated_from_script_length_and_waveform_pauses_not_word_level_forced_alignment"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 5,
      "start_seconds": 21.04,
      "end_seconds": 26.44,
      "start_frame": 631,
      "end_frame": 793,
      "transcript": "Every roll changed the law. One floated loose objects. Two made everyone walk backward. Three lifted people into the air.",
      "timing_status": "estimated_from_script_length_and_waveform_pauses_not_word_level_forced_alignment"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 6,
      "start_seconds": 26.44,
      "end_seconds": 29.54,
      "start_frame": 793,
      "end_frame": 886,
      "transcript": "But in thirty years, the die had never landed on six.",
      "timing_status": "estimated_from_script_length_and_waveform_pauses_not_word_level_forced_alignment"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 7,
      "start_seconds": 29.54,
      "end_seconds": 36.64,
      "start_frame": 886,
      "end_frame": 1099,
      "transcript": "Leo had counted the rolls. And he'd noticed something strange: whenever six almost appeared, the die made the exact same wobble.",
      "timing_status": "estimated_from_script_length_and_waveform_pauses_not_word_level_forced_alignment"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 8,
      "start_seconds": 36.64,
      "end_seconds": 40.68,
      "start_frame": 1099,
      "end_frame": 1220,
      "transcript": "So while the town floated above him, Leo slipped underneath the stone platform.",
      "timing_status": "estimated_from_script_length_and_waveform_pauses_not_word_level_forced_alignment"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 9,
      "start_seconds": 40.68,
      "end_seconds": 48.06,
      "start_frame": 1220,
      "end_frame": 1442,
      "transcript": "There was a brass paddle and a crank. Somebody had been knocking the die away from six before it could settle.",
      "timing_status": "estimated_from_script_length_and_waveform_pauses_not_word_level_forced_alignment"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 10,
      "start_seconds": 48.06,
      "end_seconds": 49.84,
      "start_frame": 1442,
      "end_frame": 1495,
      "transcript": "Mayor Pip was holding the handle.",
      "timing_status": "estimated_from_script_length_and_waveform_pauses_not_word_level_forced_alignment"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 11,
      "start_seconds": 49.84,
      "end_seconds": 57.0,
      "start_frame": 1495,
      "end_frame": 1710,
      "transcript": "Pip looked ten, but he'd started the game thirty years earlier. Nobody inside the town grew older. Outside, his family had.",
      "timing_status": "estimated_from_script_length_and_waveform_pauses_not_word_level_forced_alignment"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 12,
      "start_seconds": 57.0,
      "end_seconds": 58.92,
      "start_frame": 1710,
      "end_frame": 1768,
      "transcript": "Pip held their faded photograph.",
      "timing_status": "estimated_from_script_length_and_waveform_pauses_not_word_level_forced_alignment"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 13,
      "start_seconds": 58.92,
      "end_seconds": 63.5,
      "start_frame": 1768,
      "end_frame": 1905,
      "transcript": "\"If six lands, the gate opens,\" he whispered. \"What if they've forgotten me?\"",
      "timing_status": "estimated_from_script_length_and_waveform_pauses_not_word_level_forced_alignment"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 14,
      "start_seconds": 63.5,
      "end_seconds": 66.56,
      "start_frame": 1905,
      "end_frame": 1997,
      "transcript": "Leo had an answer for almost everything. But not that.",
      "timing_status": "estimated_from_script_length_and_waveform_pauses_not_word_level_forced_alignment"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 15,
      "start_seconds": 66.56,
      "end_seconds": 70.96,
      "start_frame": 1997,
      "end_frame": 2129,
      "transcript": "He pulled a small pin from the machine, stopping the paddle, and placed it in Pip's hand.",
      "timing_status": "estimated_from_script_length_and_waveform_pauses_not_word_level_forced_alignment"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 16,
      "start_seconds": 70.96,
      "end_seconds": 74.12,
      "start_frame": 2129,
      "end_frame": 2224,
      "transcript": "\"You can put it back,\" Leo said. \"I won't stop you.\"",
      "timing_status": "estimated_from_script_length_and_waveform_pauses_not_word_level_forced_alignment"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 17,
      "start_seconds": 74.12,
      "end_seconds": 77.96,
      "start_frame": 2224,
      "end_frame": 2339,
      "transcript": "The next morning, the die didn't land on six. Neither did the next.",
      "timing_status": "estimated_from_script_length_and_waveform_pauses_not_word_level_forced_alignment"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 18,
      "start_seconds": 77.96,
      "end_seconds": 86.18,
      "start_frame": 2339,
      "end_frame": 2585,
      "transcript": "Five mornings went by. Pip watched each roll, holding the pin. Once, he almost returned it. Then he looked at the photograph and put it down.",
      "timing_status": "estimated_from_script_length_and_waveform_pauses_not_word_level_forced_alignment"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 19,
      "start_seconds": 86.18,
      "end_seconds": 88.98,
      "start_frame": 2585,
      "end_frame": 2669,
      "transcript": "On the sixth sunrise, the die began to turn.",
      "timing_status": "estimated_from_script_length_and_waveform_pauses_not_word_level_forced_alignment"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 20,
      "start_seconds": 88.98,
      "end_seconds": 90.52,
      "start_frame": 2669,
      "end_frame": 2716,
      "transcript": "It rocked toward six.",
      "timing_status": "estimated_from_script_length_and_waveform_pauses_not_word_level_forced_alignment"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 21,
      "start_seconds": 90.52,
      "end_seconds": 92.9,
      "start_frame": 2716,
      "end_frame": 2787,
      "transcript": "Pip reached for the pin, and stopped himself.",
      "timing_status": "estimated_from_script_length_and_waveform_pauses_not_word_level_forced_alignment"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 22,
      "start_seconds": 92.9,
      "end_seconds": 95.0,
      "start_frame": 2787,
      "end_frame": 2850,
      "transcript": "The die settled.",
      "timing_status": "estimated_from_script_length_and_waveform_pauses_not_word_level_forced_alignment"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 23,
      "start_seconds": 95.0,
      "end_seconds": 96.6,
      "start_frame": 2850,
      "end_frame": 2898,
      "transcript": "Six.",
      "timing_status": "estimated_from_script_length_and_waveform_pauses_not_word_level_forced_alignment"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 24,
      "start_seconds": 96.6,
      "end_seconds": 103.0,
      "start_frame": 2898,
      "end_frame": 3090,
      "transcript": "The town gate swung open. Pip ran through it, past streets he barely recognized, until he reached his old house.",
      "timing_status": "estimated_from_script_length_and_waveform_pauses_not_word_level_forced_alignment"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 25,
      "start_seconds": 103.0,
      "end_seconds": 107.66,
      "start_frame": 3090,
      "end_frame": 3230,
      "transcript": "An older woman stood in the doorway. She took one look at him and said his name.",
      "timing_status": "estimated_from_script_length_and_waveform_pauses_not_word_level_forced_alignment"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 26,
      "start_seconds": 107.66,
      "end_seconds": 111.46,
      "start_frame": 3230,
      "end_frame": 3344,
      "transcript": "Inside was a small chair by the kitchen table. Everything had changed except that chair.",
      "timing_status": "estimated_from_script_length_and_waveform_pauses_not_word_level_forced_alignment"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 27,
      "start_seconds": 111.46,
      "end_seconds": 112.98,
      "start_frame": 3344,
      "end_frame": 3389,
      "transcript": "\"We kept your chair,\" she said.",
      "timing_status": "estimated_from_script_length_and_waveform_pauses_not_word_level_forced_alignment"
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 28,
      "start_seconds": 112.98,
      "end_seconds": 117.098,
      "start_frame": 3389,
      "end_frame": 3513,
      "transcript": "And Leo, watching from the open gate, finally closed his notebook without planning tomorrow.",
      "timing_status": "estimated_from_script_length_and_waveform_pauses_not_word_level_forced_alignment"
    }
  ],
